# SwiftUI architecture (layered)

Use the **swiftui-architecture** skill when scaffolding features or reviewing structure.

## Dependency flow

Construction: `App` / Factory wire Manager, UseCase, ViewModel (Factory optional).

Runtime: `View → ViewModel → UseCase → Manager` (unidirectional).

Factory = build managers (incl. availability/config) + optional `make[Feature]ViewModel()` — not business logic.

## Rules

- ViewModels depend on **use case protocols** only — never managers.
- Views depend on **view models** only — never use cases or managers.
- Use **protocol types** in `init` parameters.
- ViewModels: `@Observable`, `@MainActor`, nested `ViewState` enum.

## New feature

Propose folder tree and protocols first; scaffold files after approval.

